{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-14T19:14:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066237830490468657"],"id":"2066237830490468657","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4365,"like_count":69,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":6},"text":"人一旦生了锈就怎么擦都不会闪闪发光了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066237830490468657"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-14T17:02:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066204628560261133"],"id":"2066204628560261133","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":6169,"like_count":114,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":12},"text":"你太懂珍惜 以致对拥有产生了恐惧","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066204628560261133"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-14T16:45:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066200446453297538"],"id":"2066200446453297538","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":4777,"like_count":74,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":7},"text":"我们在彼此的生命里留下那么深的痕迹还怎么做回甲乙丙丁","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066200446453297538"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-14T16:40:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066198989087924388"],"id":"2066198989087924388","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":3398,"like_count":90,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":11},"text":"我之前会想，要是你幸福的话，那就算你和别人在一起我也会祝福的。我不想让你喜欢别人了……我想让你一直都喜欢我，最喜欢我也只喜欢我。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066198989087924388"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-14T16:38:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066198595121152120"],"id":"2066198595121152120","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2113,"like_count":35,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":1},"text":"见面，只是为了彻底告别旧模式，迎来新希望","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066198595121152120"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-14T16:37:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066198260474380482"],"id":"2066198260474380482","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5020,"like_count":69,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":3},"text":"我到底该和谁倾诉我的痛苦？","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066198260474380482"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-14T06:07:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066039717486105069"],"id":"2066039717486105069","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4394,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":0},"text":"看到我身边朋友也这样我就释然很多了 https://t.co/OWlhtVejUF","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066039717486105069"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-14T06:03:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066038858488430634"],"id":"2066038858488430634","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1499,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":29,"retweet_count":0},"text":"银色圈条上一锤一锤印刻的字母已经透过血肉记在了骨节上，而你也一样透过时间刻在了我的生命里","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066038858488430634"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-14T06:01:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066038404782178560"],"id":"2066038404782178560","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":5175,"like_count":113,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":20},"text":"我想你了。你不会再说想我了吧。但是我还是好想你。好想和你聊天讲话。好想听你对着我笑。好想你也想我。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066038404782178560"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-14T05:58:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066037478017184209"],"id":"2066037478017184209","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":3106,"like_count":37,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":9},"text":"时间久了我也分不清我放不下的 到底是你还是那个放不下你的我","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066037478017184209"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-14T05:57:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066037240778870976"],"id":"2066037240778870976","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":3877,"like_count":66,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":9},"text":"不知道怎样才能彻底释怀和放下你 忘却我试过了 很难很难 为什么做什么事都会想到你","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066037240778870976"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-14T05:55:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066036808346227047"],"id":"2066036808346227047","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":3865,"like_count":50,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":4},"text":"你和她在一起真的比和我在一起快乐吗","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066036808346227047"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-13T21:22:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2065907576571941254"],"id":"2065907576571941254","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2864,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"感谢小宝投喂，请认准我的抹茶流心蒸肠粉 https://t.co/GEVfUaerke","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2065907576571941254"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-13T21:19:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2065907002367516893"],"id":"2065907002367516893","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1116,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我的头疼的炸了，那种感觉就好像有人拿着锥子从你的太阳穴斜向上往脑子里凿一样。我的胃里也时不时传来灼烧感。\n为什么偏偏异类是我，为什么我作为人但就是融入不了人的社会生活里。很多事情发生之后，在回忆时，总多出一个第三视角的记忆，但现场当时并没有第三人，我又是透过谁的眼睛在看当时的我？","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2065907002367516893"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-13T21:17:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2065906403961913587"],"id":"2065906403961913587","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":2230,"like_count":53,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"假的，都是假的，从来都是我在追逐月亮，而明月高悬，独不照我。我永远都是那个合适的选择，而不是第一选择。我没办法了，我要被内心的嫉妒和极大的不平衡感吞噬殆尽了。我不会再有任何期待了，克隆人的生活我已经过够了，我再也不想模仿了。\n我又何苦为了融入而不停的去模仿我见过的每一个人。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2065906403961913587"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-13T21:16:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2065906105998569872"],"id":"2065906105998569872","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1100,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"到现在还真的有人一直记得我爱看月亮吗，但现在用月亮思念的人越来越多，我的头也慢慢的抬不起来了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2065906105998569872"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-13T21:14:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2065905616225464350"],"id":"2065905616225464350","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":1642,"like_count":27,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":2},"text":"好好活着真的很累人啊，我花了五年时间恢复，又花了半年时间回到起点","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2065905616225464350"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-13T20:20:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2065891972796359007"],"id":"2065891972796359007","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":2786,"like_count":66,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":6},"text":"当年你意气风发什么话都听不进去  正如现在的你沉默寡言什么话都说不出口","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2065891972796359007"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-13T19:37:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2065881206382903336"],"id":"2065881206382903336","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3210,"like_count":31,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":4},"text":"我总是在克制自己不对任何人产生依赖，可我好孤独…...","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2065881206382903336"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-13T19:36:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2065881125822832848"],"id":"2065881125822832848","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1557,"like_count":22,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我会下意识回避在情感上承担相应的责任，哪怕是天天居住的房间里，也没有一个能让我产生情感寄托的玩偶","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2065881125822832848"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-12T16:45:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2065475617026679278"],"id":"2065475617026679278","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2950,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":0},"text":"非常之疲惫… https://t.co/l8PMkwiBuh","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2065475617026679278"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-12T13:14:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2065422543985721475"],"id":"2065422543985721475","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":4767,"like_count":57,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":9},"text":"我的脑子里真的随时随地都在冒出不同的想法，基本没体会过脑子里安安静静的时刻，就连睡觉都是做梦不断..怪不得我日常就是没啥精力，做点事情就累得不行，我的后台一直在偷偷消耗我的能量","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2065422543985721475"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-12T09:20:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2065363504971087916"],"id":"2065363504971087916","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1323,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"开我盒太简单了一句我请你喝奶茶门牌号都给你爆出来","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2065363504971087916"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-11T18:55:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2065145934187765997"],"id":"2065145934187765997","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":3060,"like_count":41,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":5},"text":"希望某天在街边蹲着然后有一个外星人过来说好可爱的人类然后给我很多钱","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2065145934187765997"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-11T18:30:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2065139521839407526"],"id":"2065139521839407526","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":2700,"like_count":43,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":2},"text":"最近我的行动力快死了，可能是坚持苦干了太久都没有正反馈，没有一场世俗意义的成功，给我一种努力了都没用的感觉，那还不如摆烂来得轻松⋯.再加上我的身体和活力经常罢工，感觉自己困困的的，很久都没有那种头脑清醒的感觉，觉得自己仿佛生活在朦胧的雾里，不知道苦干何时才是个头","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2065139521839407526"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1917047326990094336","name":"kiri","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1917047544313679872/akAJkXe1_normal.jpg","username":"0TwT012","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2066237830490468657","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3jueqi7jna49kw8tzlv8jmmrxohlj7h","oldest_id":"2065139521839407526","result_count":25}}